Junpei.FixedGaussian.initialRiskOptimal_fixed_payoff_repair_eq (π : Junpei.Policy.StatePolicy) (T : ℕ) (hT : 3 ≤ T)
  (hπ : Junpei.InitialOptimal.InitialRiskOptimal π T) (m μ : Draft0.BayesianModel.Means)
